{
  "title": "95: At-Tin التين",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nوَالتِّيْنِ وَالزَّيْتُوْنِۙ‏(1)\nWAT TEENE WAZ ZAYTOONE.\nI swear by the fig and the olive, \nوَطُوْرِ سِيْنِيْنَۙ‏(2)\nWA TOORE SEENEENA\nAnd mount Sinai, \nوَهٰذَا الْبَلَدِ الْاَمِيْنِۙ‏(3)\nWA HAAZAL BALADIL AMEENE.\nAnd this city made secure, \nلَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا الْاِنْسَانَ فِىْۤ اَحْسَنِ تَقْوِيْمٍ‏(4)\nLAQAD KHALAQNAL INSAANA FEE AHSANE TAQWEEM.\nCertainly We created man in the best make. \nثُمَّ رَدَدْنٰهُ اَسْفَلَ سَافِلِيْنَۙ‏(5)\nSUMMA RADADNAAHO ASFALA SAAFELEENA.\nThen We render him the lowest of the low. \nاِلَّا الَّذِيْنَ اٰمَنُوْا وَعَمِلُوا الصّٰلِحٰتِ فَلَهُمْ اَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُوْنٍؕ‏(6)\nILLAL LAZEENA AAMANOO WA A’MELUS SAALEHAATE FA-LAHUM AJRUN GHAYRO MAMNOON.\nExcept those who believe and do good, so they shall have a reward never to be cut off. \nفَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعْدُ بِالدِّيْنِ‏(7)\nFAMAA YOKAZZEBOKA BA’DO BID-DEEN.\nThen who can give you the lie after (this) about the judgment? \nاَلَيْسَ اللّٰهُ بِاَحْكَمِ الْحٰكِمِيْنَ‏(8)\nA LAYSAL LAAHO BE-AHKAMIL HAAKEMEEN.\nIs not Allah the best of the Judges? ",
  "merits": "This Surah was revealed in Makkah and has 8 verses. Imam Ja’far as-Sadiq (a.s.) has said the reward for reciting this Surah in prayers is a great palace in Jannah.\nIt is narrated from the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) that the reward given to the person who recites this Surah cannot be counted. If recited on food, its evil effects are removed. The one who recites this Surah is compared to the person who has visited the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and had his needs fulfilled by him."
